{"format":"tk-cutscene/1","world":21,"tile":"tiles","scenes":{"m1":{"place":"susaek-dong--baduk-class","spot":"m1","node":"21-m1","party":["ms_jang_child"],"cast":{"ms_jang_child":{"who":"ms_jang_child","side":"us"},"un":{"who":"ms_uncle","side":"them"}},"beats":[{"do":"cut","place":[{"actor":"ms_jang_child","at":[12.5,8.85],"face":"left"}]},{"do":"camera","to":[12.0,8.5],"ms":600},{"do":"appear","place":[{"actor":"un","at":[6.5,8.85],"face":"right"}]},{"do":"together","beats":[{"do":"walk","actor":"un","path":[[6.5,8.85],[7.5,8.85],[7.5,9.85],[11.5,9.85],[11.5,8.85]],"speed":4.0}]},{"do":"line","line":["n","Misaeng: not yet alive. A group on a go board that is neither alive nor dead.","","fbcb8ed0f2fb"],"camera":[12.0,8.5]},{"do":"line","line":["n","It started with his uncle's stones. He nearly swallowed a few. It didn't spoil the fun.","","1277157bfab6"],"camera":[12.0,8.5]},{"do":"line","line":["say","ms_uncle","Go on, then. Where would you play?","","fee41aece363"],"speaker":"un","face":[{"actor":"un","dir":"right"},{"actor":"ms_jang_child","dir":"left"}],"camera":[12.0,8.5]},{"do":"problem"},{"do":"line","line":["say","ms_jang_child","Atari!","","9ed902ef42b9"],"speaker":"ms_jang_child","face":[{"actor":"ms_jang_child","dir":"left"},{"actor":"un","dir":"right"}],"camera":[12.0,8.5]},{"do":"line","line":["n","Baduk is good for concentration, his uncle said, and his mother gladly paid for the neighbourhood class. Soon he was winning his uncle's and his father's bets back from Mr. Kim at the laundromat.","","a2e98c741d4a"],"camera":[12.0,8.5]},{"do":"line","line":["n","Then an amateur six-dan's academy. His mother objected; nobody thought he'd conquer the baduk world. Nobody could stop a nine-year-old with a problem book at dawn, either.","","82163895ea51"],"camera":[12.0,8.5]},{"do":"line","line":["n","Then a professional's dojang. Prodigy: to his parents the word was a sedative. And his father's company had just gone under.","","c5415567585d"],"camera":[12.0,8.5]},{"do":"fade","actors":["un"]},{"do":"party","list":["ms_jang_young"]}],"end":{"leader":[12.5,8.85]},"facing":"left"},"m2":{"place":"korea-baduk-association--kba-trainees","spot":"m2","node":"21-m2","party":["ms_jang_young"],"cast":{"ms_jang_young":{"who":"ms_jang_young","side":"us"},"tr":{"who":"ms_trainee","side":"them"}},"beats":[{"do":"cut","place":[{"actor":"ms_jang_young","at":[15.5,10.85],"face":"right"}]},{"do":"scroll","args":["Seven Years Later",["At eleven he entered the Korea Baduk Association as a trainee: a child studying to turn professional. The age limit comes at eighteen. He is eighteen now."],"",[""],["4833bd644161"]]},{"do":"appear","place":[{"actor":"tr","at":[16.5,10.85],"face":"left"}]},{"do":"line","line":["n","At home his parents cut Lee Chang-ho and Lee Sedol out of the papers: rankings, prize money.","","cd1d8f861de5"],"camera":[16.0,10.5]},{"do":"problem"},{"do":"fade","actors":["tr"]},{"do":"line","line":["n","He failed to turn pro.","","2124f528f08d"],"camera":[15.5,10.5]},{"do":"line","line":["n","Only now does he see his father's wrinkles, and how dull his mother's eyes have gone.","","01f583d40985"],"camera":[15.5,10.5]},{"do":"line","line":["n","The day he leaves is an ordinary day. Tomorrow, it feels, he'll be back here, losing to younger kids. He hasn't changed. Everyone else has, and the colour has gone out of the world.","","e207a9d7b0bc"],"camera":[15.5,10.5]},{"do":"line","line":["n","Not talent. Not luck, or the half-point losses. Not the part-time jobs, or his father's death, or his mother in bed. Those would hurt too much. So: he didn't try hard enough.","","201312f4e2fe"],"camera":[15.5,10.5]},{"do":"still","id":"ms_lastgame","move":"out"},{"do":"line","line":["n","He walks away dropping stones from his pocket, a few at a time.","","982252d98701"],"camera":[15.5,10.5]},{"do":"line","line":["n","Because he didn't try hard enough, he had to come out into the world. Because he didn't try hard enough, he was thrown away.","","63258d7ed522"],"camera":[15.5,10.5]},{"do":"party","list":["ms_jang"]}],"end":{"leader":[15.5,10.85]},"facing":"right"},"m4":{"place":"susaek-dong--home","spot":"m4","node":"21-m4","party":["ms_jang"],"cast":{"ms_jang":{"who":"ms_jang","side":"us"},"mo":{"who":"ms_mother","side":"them"}},"beats":[{"do":"cut","place":[{"actor":"ms_jang","at":[9.5,7.85],"face":"right"}]},{"do":"scroll","args":["Years Later",["He quit baduk. He has no degree, no trade, and a mother to look after. He has just come out of the army."],"",[""],["2c7520e2d6e3"]]},{"do":"appear","place":[{"actor":"mo","at":[8.5,7.85],"face":"left"}]},{"do":"line","line":["n","His friends from the trainee room turned pro. When he packed up, they asked if he was really quitting. He had no answer. He put his game records out with the board.","","66e956e4e52c"],"camera":[9.0,7.5]},{"do":"line","line":["n","The family restaurant failed. His mother worked building sites until her body gave out. He studied for the equivalency exam between part-time jobs, and in the bathroom he washed her back.","","9569e5982006"],"camera":[9.0,7.5]},{"do":"line","line":["n","His old sponsor once gave him a job at his company. Baduk? What dan? Then: why did you quit? Then: no flexibility. He fled to the army.","","ea1ad6fbda9a"],"camera":[9.0,7.5]},{"do":"line","line":["say","ms_mother","Go and thank him. The president who gave you that job. You owe him that.","","727b70e620f1"],"speaker":"mo","face":[{"actor":"mo","dir":"right"},{"actor":"ms_jang","dir":"left"}],"camera":[9.0,7.5]},{"do":"fade","actors":["mo"]},{"do":"party","list":["ms_jang"]}],"end":{"leader":[9.5,7.85]},"facing":"right"},"m5":{"place":"jongno--sponsor-office","spot":"m5","node":"21-m5","party":["ms_jang"],"cast":{"ms_jang":{"who":"ms_jang","side":"us"},"sp":{"who":"ms_sponsor","side":"them"},"ms_bujang":{"who":"ms_bujang","side":"them"}},"beats":[{"do":"cut","place":[{"actor":"ms_jang","at":[12.5,8.85],"face":"left"}]},{"do":"camera","to":[12.0,8.5],"ms":600},{"do":"appear","place":[{"actor":"sp","at":[6.5,7.85],"face":"right"}]},{"do":"together","beats":[{"do":"walk","actor":"sp","path":[[6.5,7.85],[11.5,7.85],[11.5,8.85]],"speed":4.0}]},{"do":"line","line":["say","ms_sponsor","I've talked to a friend who runs a trading company: One International. Only he knows about the baduk. It'll be a simple interview.","","24ab34f96814"],"speaker":"sp","face":[{"actor":"sp","dir":"right"},{"actor":"ms_jang","dir":"left"}],"camera":[12.0,8.5]},{"do":"line","line":["say","ms_sponsor","But your papers are thin. You'll go in with nothing. Some will call you a parachute.","","29948fc99ddc"],"speaker":"sp","face":[{"actor":"sp","dir":"right"},{"actor":"ms_jang","dir":"left"}],"camera":[12.0,8.5]},{"do":"line","line":["say","ms_jang","Thank you. Thank you, sir.","","1f4b47691441"],"speaker":"ms_jang","face":[{"actor":"ms_jang","dir":"left"},{"actor":"sp","dir":"right"}],"camera":[12.0,8.5]},{"do":"fade","actors":["sp"]},{"do":"line","line":["n","The city puts its make-up on: office workers toasting, flattering, going home. Start from the bottom, like everyone else. Don't fail the way you failed at baduk.","","2f58bb46f722"],"camera":[12.5,8.5]},{"do":"line","line":["n","If there's a light I must keep burning, I'll answer for it. If there's a light allowed me. Is there one, for me?","","3961ba9dd620"],"camera":[12.5,8.5]},{"do":"scroll","args":["The First Day",["The alarm. The alarm again. His mother ties his tie. A struggling group from the very first move."],"",[""],["7944b8db4ed5"]]},{"do":"line","line":["n","A message from upstairs: don't come to the office. Go straight to a café in Jongno. A buyer from overseas is waiting, and nobody else can meet him.","","e10f366f0f55"],"camera":[12.5,8.5]},{"do":"gain","item":"cafe_address"},{"do":"scroll","args":["Meanwhile",["Oh Sang-sik, section head of Sales Team 3 at One International. Red eyes, three sons, too much work. Today he promised the boys a mountain, and forgot the eleven o'clock meeting with that buyer."],"",[""],["eae11e8baeed"]]},{"do":"appear","place":[{"actor":"ms_bujang","at":[8.5,8.85],"face":"right"}]},{"do":"line","line":["say","ms_bujang","Where are you? The buyer's waiting. I'm sending today's new hire. Are we in a position to be picky?","","dfd4e555bf63"],"speaker":"ms_bujang","face":[{"actor":"ms_bujang","dir":"right"},{"actor":"ms_jang","dir":"left"}],"camera":[10.5,8.5]},{"do":"party","list":["ms_oh_hike"]},{"do":"fade","actors":["ms_bujang"]}],"end":{"leader":[12.5,8.85]},"facing":"left"},"m7":{"place":"mountain","spot":"m7","node":"21-m7","party":["ms_oh_hike"],"cast":{"ms_oh_hike":{"who":"ms_oh_hike","side":"us"},"ms_bujang":{"who":"ms_bujang","side":"them"}},"beats":[{"do":"cut","place":[{"actor":"ms_oh_hike","at":[29.5,57.85],"face":"right"}]},{"do":"line","line":["n","Into the car. The road in moves five hundred metres in thirty minutes.","","1f8e9de0d03a"],"camera":[29.5,57.5]},{"do":"line","line":["say","ms_oh_hike","There was a paper at the workshop. Fear is mostly irrational...","","f01d863283df"],"speaker":"ms_oh_hike","face":[],"camera":[29.5,57.5]},{"do":"appear","place":[{"actor":"ms_bujang","at":[33.5,57.85],"face":"left"}]},{"do":"line","line":["say","ms_bujang","Shall I tell you about dismissal-notice pay?","","4e35a93d69d9"],"speaker":"ms_bujang","face":[{"actor":"ms_bujang","dir":"left"},{"actor":"ms_oh_hike","dir":"right"}],"camera":[31.5,57.5]},{"do":"line","line":["say","ms_oh_hike","Mangwon-dong crossroads. Twelve kilometres an hour. Eight to go. Thirty minutes late. Fear is rational.","","82384401e029"],"speaker":"ms_oh_hike","face":[{"actor":"ms_oh_hike","dir":"right"},{"actor":"ms_bujang","dir":"left"}],"camera":[31.5,57.5]},{"do":"party","list":["ms_jang"]},{"do":"fade","actors":["ms_bujang"]}],"end":{"leader":[29.5,57.85]},"facing":"right"},"m8":{"place":"jongno--cafe","spot":"m8","node":"21-m8","party":["ms_jang"],"cast":{"ms_jang":{"who":"ms_jang","side":"us"},"by":{"who":"ms_buyer","side":"them"},"ks":{"who":"ms_kangsil","side":"them"},"oh":{"who":"ms_oh_hike","side":"them"},"kd":{"who":"ms_kimds","side":"them"}},"beats":[{"do":"cut","place":[{"actor":"ms_jang","at":[12.5,8.85],"face":"left"}]},{"do":"camera","to":[12.0,8.5],"ms":600},{"do":"appear","place":[{"actor":"by","at":[6.5,7.85],"face":"right"},{"actor":"ks","at":[6.5,9.85],"face":"right"}]},{"do":"together","beats":[{"do":"walk","actor":"by","path":[[6.5,7.85],[11.5,7.85]],"speed":4.0},{"do":"walk","actor":"ks","path":[[6.5,9.85],[11.5,9.85]],"speed":4.0}]},{"do":"line","line":["n","A buyer from overseas and his manager, Kang. From One International, only a new hire with no papers. He can't talk trade. He can talk one thing.","","5610157bc153"],"camera":[12.0,8.5]},{"do":"line","line":["say","ms_buyer","A puzzle? All right. Black to play?","","e678be340441"],"speaker":"by","face":[{"actor":"by","dir":"right"},{"actor":"ms_jang","dir":"left"}],"camera":[12.0,8.0]},{"do":"problem"},{"do":"appear","place":[{"actor":"oh","at":[9.5,8.85],"face":"right"}]},{"do":"walk","actor":"oh","path":[[9.5,8.85]],"speed":4.0},{"do":"line","line":["n","Oh bursts in, thirty minutes late, hiking clothes under his jacket.","","eb7c1fc386f6"],"camera":[11.0,8.5]},{"do":"line","line":["say","ms_kangsil","Your young man kept us busy. The quiz was fun.","","7fe8b20a1f63"],"speaker":"ks","face":[{"actor":"ks","dir":"right"},{"actor":"ms_jang","dir":"left"}],"camera":[12.0,9.0]},{"do":"line","line":["say","ms_buyer","What is this game called?","","504e07124635"],"speaker":"by","face":[{"actor":"by","dir":"right"},{"actor":"ms_jang","dir":"left"}],"camera":[12.0,8.0]},{"do":"line","line":["say","ms_jang","Baduk.","","425b23f02af5"],"speaker":"ms_jang","face":[{"actor":"ms_jang","dir":"left"},{"actor":"by","dir":"right"}],"camera":[12.0,8.0]},{"do":"fade","actors":["by","ks"]},{"do":"line","line":["n","In Oh's car: paper cups, red eyes, a claim argued down the phone. Jang once lost to a trainee just like this: sloppy, red-eyed, bored. He read him as careless, and was wrong.","","e939b8e360e1"],"camera":[11.0,8.5]},{"do":"problem"},{"do":"line","line":["n","Obsessive. Responsible. A man who carries everything.","","14e976c37737"],"camera":[11.0,8.5]},{"do":"fade","actors":["oh"]},{"do":"scroll","args":["Human Resources",["He is an intern, attached to Sales Team 3. In two months the interns sit a PT, a presentation test. Pass it, and you stay."],"",[""],["42f5decd8b15"]]},{"do":"appear","place":[{"actor":"kd","at":[11.5,7.85],"face":"right"}]},{"do":"line","line":["say","ms_kimds","Kim Dong-sik, assistant manager. I'm your buddy; Oh's your mentor. First: this requisition, to General Affairs.","","cbd0c1719ffa"],"speaker":"kd","face":[{"actor":"kd","dir":"right"},{"actor":"ms_jang","dir":"left"}],"camera":[12.0,8.0]},{"do":"gain","item":"requisition"},{"do":"fade","actors":["kd"]},{"do":"party","list":["ms_jang"]}],"end":{"leader":[12.5,8.85]},"facing":"left"},"m10":{"place":"one-international--sales3","spot":"m10","node":"21-m10","party":["ms_jang"],"cast":{"ms_jang":{"who":"ms_jang","side":"us"},"kd":{"who":"ms_kimds","side":"them"},"gl":{"who":"ms_glasses","side":"them"}},"beats":[{"do":"cut","place":[{"actor":"ms_jang","at":[18.5,11.85],"face":"left"}]},{"do":"line","line":["n","General Affairs hands over a box of supplies, a glue stick among them.","","d4b99db67106"],"camera":[18.5,11.5]},{"do":"gain","item":"glue_stick"},{"do":"appear","place":[{"actor":"kd","at":[17.5,11.85],"face":"right"}]},{"do":"line","line":["say","ms_kimds","Sort these files into my folders.","","17c0f133d40a"],"speaker":"kd","face":[{"actor":"kd","dir":"right"},{"actor":"ms_jang","dir":"left"}],"camera":[18.0,11.5]},{"do":"line","line":["n","He draws a mind map and builds a better tree. It takes an afternoon.","","c59c3992f565"],"camera":[18.0,11.5]},{"do":"emote","actors":["kd"],"icon":"anger"},{"do":"line","line":["say","ms_kimds","Where are my folders? Who do you think you are?","","b908980eb761"],"speaker":"kd","face":[{"actor":"kd","dir":"right"},{"actor":"ms_jang","dir":"left"}],"camera":[18.0,11.5]},{"do":"line","line":["say","ms_kimds","That structure is the company's. This isn't work you do alone. It's work you do together.","","6e7728653015"],"speaker":"kd","face":[{"actor":"kd","dir":"right"},{"actor":"ms_jang","dir":"left"}],"camera":[18.0,11.5]},{"do":"line","line":["n","At fifteen he filed his game records his own way. A system only he ever had to read.","","55a8fcc2c65f"],"camera":[18.0,11.5]},{"do":"fade","actors":["kd"]},{"do":"appear","place":[{"actor":"gl","at":[17.5,11.85],"face":"right"}]},{"do":"line","line":["say","ms_glasses","Interns' study tonight. And we find out who the dud is.","","6a435ebbc98c"],"speaker":"gl","face":[{"actor":"gl","dir":"right"},{"actor":"ms_jang","dir":"left"}],"camera":[18.0,11.5]},{"do":"fade","actors":["gl"]},{"do":"party","list":["ms_jang"]}],"end":{"leader":[18.5,11.85]},"facing":"left"},"m10_wait":{"place":"one-international--sales3","spot":"m10","node":"21-m10","party":["ms_jang"],"cast":{"ms_jang":{"who":"ms_jang","side":"us"}},"beats":[{"do":"cut","place":[{"actor":"ms_jang","at":[18.5,11.85],"face":"left"}]},{"do":"line","line":["say","ms_jang","The requisition first. General Affairs.","","72f345e80d1b"],"speaker":"ms_jang","face":[],"camera":[18.5,11.5]}],"end":{"leader":[18.5,11.85]},"facing":"left"},"m12":{"place":"jongno--hof","spot":"m12","node":"21-m12","party":["ms_jang"],"cast":{"ms_jang":{"who":"ms_jang","side":"us"},"ahn":{"who":"ms_ahn","side":"them"},"gl":{"who":"ms_glasses","side":"them"}},"beats":[{"do":"cut","place":[{"actor":"ms_jang","at":[13.5,8.85],"face":"right"}]},{"do":"camera","to":[13.5,8.5],"ms":600},{"do":"appear","place":[{"actor":"ahn","at":[7.5,8.85],"face":"right"},{"actor":"gl","at":[19.5,8.85],"face":"left"}]},{"do":"together","beats":[{"do":"walk","actor":"ahn","path":[[7.5,8.85],[12.5,8.85]],"speed":4.0},{"do":"walk","actor":"gl","path":[[19.5,8.85],[14.5,8.85]],"speed":4.0}]},{"do":"line","line":["n","A bar full of interns pitching PT topics. Ahn Young-yi, top of the intake and the only woman among them, watches him.","","c6ea9809bd59"],"camera":[13.5,8.5]},{"do":"line","line":["say","ms_ahn","You haven't said a word. You won't learn by listening.","","c1d7177a5aae"],"speaker":"ahn","face":[{"actor":"ahn","dir":"right"},{"actor":"ms_jang","dir":"left"}],"camera":[13.0,8.5]},{"do":"line","line":["say","ms_ahn","And you've got filing due tomorrow, and you're sitting here? Secure your own stones, then attack.","","b5d6533a7a68"],"speaker":"ahn","face":[{"actor":"ahn","dir":"right"},{"actor":"ms_jang","dir":"left"}],"camera":[13.0,8.5]},{"do":"problem"},{"do":"line","line":["n","He lived by that proverb all his life, and had to hear it from someone else. He runs back to the office.","","81aea1698537"],"camera":[13.5,8.5]},{"do":"line","line":["say","ms_ahn","He really does have filing due. Come on. You're going to apologise.","","e6f5683864d9"],"speaker":"ahn","face":[{"actor":"ahn","dir":"right"},{"actor":"ms_jang","dir":"left"}],"camera":[13.0,8.5]},{"do":"fade","actors":["ahn","gl"]},{"do":"party","list":["ms_ahn"]}],"end":{"leader":[13.5,8.85]},"facing":"right"},"m13":{"place":"one-international--sales3","spot":"m13","node":"21-m13","party":["ms_ahn"],"cast":{"ms_ahn":{"who":"ms_ahn","side":"us"},"jg":{"who":"ms_jang","side":"them"},"gl":{"who":"ms_glasses","side":"them"},"oh":{"who":"ms_oh","side":"them"},"kd":{"who":"ms_kimds","side":"them"}},"beats":[{"do":"cut","place":[{"actor":"ms_ahn","at":[18.5,11.85],"face":"left"}]},{"do":"camera","to":[17.0,12.0],"ms":600},{"do":"appear","place":[{"actor":"jg","at":[12.5,11.85],"face":"right"},{"actor":"gl","at":[11.5,11.85],"face":"right"},{"actor":"oh","at":[10.5,11.85],"face":"right"},{"actor":"kd","at":[11.5,12.85],"face":"right"}]},{"do":"together","beats":[{"do":"walk","actor":"jg","path":[[12.5,11.85],[17.5,11.85]],"speed":4.0},{"do":"walk","actor":"gl","path":[[11.5,11.85],[16.5,11.85]],"speed":4.0},{"do":"walk","actor":"oh","path":[[10.5,11.85],[15.5,11.85]],"speed":4.0},{"do":"walk","actor":"kd","path":[[11.5,12.85],[16.5,12.85]],"speed":4.0}]},{"do":"line","line":["say","ms_glasses","Sorry. I didn't know you had urgent work.","","0a4c88ef02ac"],"speaker":"gl","face":[{"actor":"gl","dir":"right"},{"actor":"ms_ahn","dir":"left"}],"camera":[17.5,11.5]},{"do":"line","line":["say","ms_ahn","His scheme is rational. But only the staff share the old order.","","26863a499417"],"speaker":"ms_ahn","face":[{"actor":"ms_ahn","dir":"left"},{"actor":"jg","dir":"right"}],"camera":[18.0,11.5]},{"do":"problem"},{"do":"line","line":["say","ms_ahn","Keep Kim's order for the executives' file. Use Jang's cross-index from the planning stage, and departments could line up.","","223525024050"],"speaker":"ms_ahn","face":[{"actor":"ms_ahn","dir":"left"},{"actor":"jg","dir":"right"}],"camera":[18.0,11.5]},{"do":"line","line":["say","ms_kimds","...Good idea.","","87c1a188edbf"],"speaker":"kd","face":[{"actor":"kd","dir":"right"},{"actor":"ms_ahn","dir":"left"}],"camera":[17.5,12.0]},{"do":"line","line":["n","She kept herself alive, and him too. Both live.","","d6b2c8dd1be9"],"camera":[17.0,12.0]},{"do":"fade","actors":["jg","gl","oh","kd"]},{"do":"still","id":"ms_25stones","move":"out"},{"do":"line","line":["n","That night he dreams of a board: rows of white stones, and one black.","","55c7b62b55a1"],"camera":[18.5,11.5]},{"do":"party","list":["ms_jang"]}],"end":{"leader":[18.5,11.85]},"facing":"left"},"m14":{"place":"one-international--sales3","spot":"m14","node":"21-m14","party":["ms_jang"],"cast":{"ms_jang":{"who":"ms_jang","side":"us"},"ahn":{"who":"ms_ahn","side":"them"},"kd":{"who":"ms_kimds","side":"them"}},"beats":[{"do":"cut","place":[{"actor":"ms_jang","at":[18.5,11.85],"face":"left"}]},{"do":"line","line":["n","Up before the alarm, crushed on the train. The world is faster than me.","","1e9d501f41d9"],"camera":[18.5,11.5]},{"do":"problem"},{"do":"line","line":["n","Plain and safe, not perfect and late.","","eca64192084c"],"camera":[18.5,11.5]},{"do":"appear","place":[{"actor":"ahn","at":[17.5,11.85],"face":"right"}]},{"do":"line","line":["say","ms_ahn","The PT dates are set: the first week of next month, a whole week at the training centre. Individual tasks and a team task. Think about partners.","","44351756d9dd"],"speaker":"ahn","face":[{"actor":"ahn","dir":"right"},{"actor":"ms_jang","dir":"left"}],"camera":[18.0,11.5]},{"do":"fade","actors":["ahn"]},{"do":"appear","place":[{"actor":"kd","at":[17.5,11.85],"face":"right"}]},{"do":"line","line":["say","ms_kimds","Everyone wants you. No confidence, no skills. Pair with a sure dud and you shine.","","b2e2bced9155"],"speaker":"kd","face":[{"actor":"kd","dir":"right"},{"actor":"ms_jang","dir":"left"}],"camera":[18.0,11.5]},{"do":"line","line":["say","ms_kimds","Be careful of whoever comes to you first.","","f72cb3c6908a"],"speaker":"kd","face":[{"actor":"kd","dir":"right"},{"actor":"ms_jang","dir":"left"}],"camera":[18.0,11.5]},{"do":"fade","actors":["kd"]},{"do":"party","list":["ms_jang"]}],"end":{"leader":[18.5,11.85]},"facing":"left"},"m14_wait":{"place":"one-international--sales3","spot":"m14","node":"21-m14","party":["ms_jang"],"cast":{"ms_jang":{"who":"ms_jang","side":"us"}},"beats":[{"do":"cut","place":[{"actor":"ms_jang","at":[18.5,11.85],"face":"left"}]},{"do":"line","line":["say","ms_jang","Kim's B/L call to the forwarder. The copies. The floor. All at once.","","f443420c2b6f"],"speaker":"ms_jang","face":[],"camera":[18.5,11.5]}],"end":{"leader":[18.5,11.85]},"facing":"left"},"m16":{"place":"jongno","spot":"m16","node":"21-m16","party":["ms_jang"],"cast":{"ms_jang":{"who":"ms_jang","side":"us"},"ahn":{"who":"ms_ahn","side":"them"},"han":{"who":"ms_han","side":"them"}},"beats":[{"do":"cut","place":[{"actor":"ms_jang","at":[60.5,31.85],"face":"right"}]},{"do":"camera","to":[60.0,31.5],"ms":600},{"do":"appear","place":[{"actor":"ahn","at":[54.5,31.85],"face":"right"}]},{"d